OL,3,GNEWSACharity reveals hidden cost of
OL,4,A'unsuitable' donations
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity has said it is spending about
OL,7,F#2,500 a month disposing of
OL,8,F"unsuitable" items that cannot be sold
OL,9,For recycled.
OL,11,FDorset Blind Association runs 12 shops
OL,12,Facross the county and said it was
OL,13,Freceiving "increasing numbers" of
OL,14,Fstained, damaged and broken items.
OL,16,FIt said each unsuitable donation "also
OL,17,Ftakes up valuable volunteer time and
OL,18,Fshop space".
